card.statement:
Any $\mathcal{H} \in s\mathrm{Der}(s\mathrm{Der}(A),A)_0$ induces a functor

\begin{align*}
\mathcal{F}_{\mathcal{H}}: {\bf WMod}_A(s\mathrm{Der}(A)) &\to {\bf WMod}_A(s\mathrm{Der}(A))\\
(M;\rho,\gamma) & \mapsto \Big(M;\rho, \rho \circ (\mathcal{H}\otimes \id_A) +\gamma \Big).
\end{align*}
